stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> Observe
    Observe --> Pending: created or missing
    Observe --> Corroborate: running or exited
    Pending --> Observe: budget remains
    Pending --> Incomplete: budget exhausted
    Corroborate --> Observe: identity changed
    Corroborate --> Complete: same IDs, running or recognized exit 0
    Corroborate --> Incomplete: same IDs, failed state
    Complete --> [*]
    Incomplete --> [*]
